# LienRho Antigravity Rules

## Artifacts
Always create artifacts directly in the repository itself (e.g., in the `docs/` or root directory) instead of using the global default artifact directory (`~/.gemini/...`). 
When using the `write_to_file` tool to create artifacts, do NOT include the `ArtifactMetadata` property; just write standard markdown files into the repository to ensure they are tracked by version control.
